      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Excellent Investment Opportunity in a Prime North Dublin Location\r\n\r\nApartment 121 is a well-presented one-bedroom apartment extending to approximately 51 sq. m., situated at the ground floor within the popular Carrington development at Northwood, Dublin 9. With a B3 BER rating, a practical layout and an exceptionally convenient location, the property should appeal to both owner-occupiers and investors seeking a well-connected North Dublin property.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a bright living area, a fully fitted kitchen, a double bedroom with built-in wardrobes, and a tiled bathroom with bath. Timber flooring throughout much of the apartment, contemporary kitchen cabinetry and excellent storage contribute to a comfortable, low-maintenance home.\r\n\r\nStrong Investment Location\r\n\r\nOne of the property’s principal attractions is its location. Northwood is strategically positioned between Dublin city centre and Dublin Airport, with convenient access to the M1, M50 and Dublin Port Tunnel. Current commercial property information for Northwood describes both Dublin Airport and Dublin City University as approximately a five-minute drive from the area. \r\n\r\nThe apartment is particularly well positioned in relation to several major employment, education and healthcare destinations:\r\n\r\n* Dublin City University — DCU’s Glasnevin campus and associated facilities are nearby, making the location attractive for people working or studying at the university. \r\n* Dublin Airport — Northwood’s proximity to the airport and M1 provides convenient access for airport employees and frequent travellers. \r\n* UPMC Sports Surgery Clinic (SSC) — importantly, the clinic is located within Northwood itself on Northwood Avenue. UPMC describes it as a major private orthopaedic and sports-medicine hospital. \r\n* Northwood also incorporates a substantial mix of medical, office, residential, hospitality and retail uses, broadening the potential local tenant and occupier base. \r\n\r\nKey Features: Approx. 51 sq. m. • One double bedroom • BER B3 • Built-in wardrobes • Separate fitted kitchen • Excellent Northwood location • Close to DCU • Dublin Airport within easy reach • UPMC Sports Surgery Clinic within Northwood • Convenient access to M1/M50 and Dublin Port Tunnel • Strong investment and owner-occupier potential."
      },
